  "derivation": [
    "Projections: gamma_n |W||x| (n = 2560 in, 6144 out). Depthwise conv: gamma_4 sum|w||x| over the 4 taps, then silu (x / (1 + exp(-x)), Lipschitz 1.0999, relative rounding). PyTorch CPU kernels: exp within 4u, log1p within 4u, sqrt correctly rounded, rsqrt = reciprocal(sqrt).",
    "Gates: beta = 1/(1 + exp(-b)); g = -exp(A_log) * softplus(fl(a + dt_bias)), softplus = log1p(exp(x)) for x <= 20 and x above 20, Lipschitz 1.",
    "l2norm: x * rsqrt(sum x^2 + 1e-6) within (1+eps_rsqrt)(1+u); queries also scale by fl(128^-0.5) (chunk) or divide by fl(sqrt 128) (recurrent).",
    "Chunk path, per head and 64-token chunk: every operation carries |da||b| + |a||db| + |da||db| + u|computed|, matmuls gamma_n, exp e^x(e^dx(1+4u) - 1), cumsum gamma_t; the unit lower solve uses (T + F)x = b, |F| <= gamma_64|T|, giving |dx| <= (I - G)^-1 |T^-1|(|db| + (|dT| + gamma(|T|+|dT|))|x|).",
    "State error E is tracked normwise: E_next = M E + local with the exact transition M = D I - K'^T W (chunk) or d(I - beta k k^T) (token); ||M||_2 is evaluated, local terms are componentwise with |S~| <= |S| + ||E||_F.",
    "Outputs: per head and chunk (or token), ||o~ - o||_F <= ||local||_F + ||Q' - Intra W||_2 ||E||_F.",
    "Gated RMSNorm: weight * x * rsqrt(mean x^2 + 1e-6) * sigmoid(z) within the composed relative rounding.",
    "Every rounding adds 2^-126 for underflow; every bound is scaled by 1 + 2^-28 to cover the float64 truth."
  ],
